01:08:14.490 --> 01:08:16.170
None of them have anything in common.

01:08:16.640 --> 01:08:20.340
Age, gender, nationality, religion, criminal record, nothing.

01:08:21.320 --> 01:08:24.840
On top of that, not one of them had a single stolen woolong on them.

01:08:25.650 --> 01:08:27.890
Well, that's all the information I could get.

01:08:28.560 --> 01:08:29.200
How about you?

01:08:30.220 --> 01:08:34.380
was so clueless he said he was following the instructions from a manual he got

01:08:34.380 --> 01:08:38.850
mail order from some website maybe the other thieves were all wannabes who read

01:08:38.850 --> 01:08:52.460
the same manual you know manual oh here all new criminal support software act

01:08:52.460 --> 01:08:57.000
now for this special offer for the low introductory price of 30,000 woolongs

