But the guys from the Gate Corporation suddenly became very uncooperative.

01:09:36.180 --> 01:09:40.640
It was as if they knew what was going on, but they didn't want to talk about it, you know?

01:09:40.820 --> 01:09:51.550
You did?

01:09:51.810 --> 01:09:51.990
Hey.

