01:11:30.000 --> 01:11:42.280
programmer who likes to play chess what it's you you too eh john you went through all that trouble

01:11:42.280 --> 01:11:53.700
for nothing like an amateur this one is much tougher than it looks jet read our bounty bullet

01:11:53.700 --> 01:11:58.140
and all the information is there it's very straightforward what else do you need to know

