01:12:44.040 --> 01:12:46.620
Either way, you'd be wise to drop this line of inquiry.

01:12:47.790 --> 01:12:51.230
Our guest is leaving now. Make sure he's escorted out of the building.

01:13:00.090 --> 01:13:03.560
