He eventually developed the central control system

01:18:05.960 --> 01:18:07.420
that all gates use to this day.

01:18:07.580 --> 01:18:10.340
But after that, he started to have doubts.

01:18:10.580 --> 01:18:13.640
He said the design had defects

01:18:13.640 --> 01:18:14.860
and the gates shouldn't be built.

01:18:15.000 --> 01:18:18.920
yet he wanted to run more tests so they fired him and built the gates anyway

01:18:18.920 --> 01:18:23.700
he's been missing for the last 50 years so he's the mastermind who taught those

01:18:23.700 --> 01:18:29.520
beginners is he trying to get revenge after all these years or what maybe if

01:18:29.520 --> 01:18:29.780
we track

01:18:30.000 --> 01:18:31.720
If we track him down, we can get to the bottom of it.

