01:18:45.600 --> 01:18:47.650
Hex, Hex, the chess master.

01:18:48.430 --> 01:18:51.160
Fjord is playing chess against him right now.

01:18:51.400 --> 01:18:51.600
Huh?

01:19:07.640 --> 01:19:11.040
I'm coming up on him. You guys standing by?

01:19:12.250 --> 01:19:12.490
Yes.

01:19:13.040 --> 01:19:18.300
Watch the false trail. I mean, look where we're heading.

01:19:18.540 --> 01:19:19.800
Would he be in a dump like that?

01:19:20.080 --> 01:19:23.020
Hold on a minute. Listen to me.

01:21:00.730 --> 01:21:01.710
Looks like there's air in here.

01:21:02.620 --> 01:21:03.620
There's someone there.

01:21:16.300 --> 01:21:18.000
You mean you've been following us? What for?

01:21:18.690 --> 01:21:19.270
Looks like this.

01:21:44.720 --> 01:21:45.080
Oh, no!

01:22:09.150 --> 01:22:09.270
Oh!

01:22:59.050 --> 01:22:59.630
the whole galaxy.

01:23:00.540 --> 01:23:02.540
And to my bank account, love, love

01:23:02.540 --> 01:23:03.540
Do you want one?

01:23:29.020 --> 01:23:29.910
Should be just a little

01:23:30.440 --> 01:23:30.740
Please?

