Man, pretending to be senile won't get you out of this.

01:23:43.230 --> 01:23:47.220
Either you give me the money you took, or I put a hole right through your brain!

01:23:48.420 --> 01:23:50.760
Heh, quite a large there.

01:23:51.180 --> 01:23:53.390
Hey! Whatcha doing, Hex?

01:23:53.550 --> 01:23:57.720
Oh, you got to see this! First formidable opponent in ages!

01:23:58.080 --> 01:23:59.940
He must be some player to pin you down!

01:24:00.000 --> 01:24:01.060
What's your next move?

01:24:01.220 --> 01:24:03.340
I don't know. Let's have lunch first.

01:24:03.700 --> 01:24:05.940
You ate lunch a few minutes ago, Blastic.

01:24:06.100 --> 01:24:07.500
Really? Did I like it?

01:24:07.810 --> 01:24:09.220
Who are these guys?

01:24:10.390 --> 01:24:13.220
Don't this one's losing it.

01:24:13.400 --> 01:24:14.660
You leave your brain somewhere?

01:24:15.210 --> 01:24:17.690
Yeah, like you can talk, you numbskull.

01:24:18.900 --> 01:24:20.520
Oh, my save bank's gone.

01:24:21.280 --> 01:24:22.960
I'll never get it back now, damn it.

01:24:23.380 --> 01:24:24.060
God damn it.

01:24:24.200 --> 01:24:26.740
Anyone, everyone, you, the whole world.

01:24:27.760 --> 01:24:28.620
It's all of us!

01:24:44.560 --> 01:24:50.170
Do with him. The old Duffer's out of touch. He can't recall yesterday, let alone 50 years ago.

01:24:51.370 --> 01:24:58.000
Lucky for him. Hex is no longer here. There's no one left but an old man who loves to play games.

01:25:01.980 --> 01:25:05.640
Hex was furious. He wanted revenge, and this is how he got it.

01:25:05.920 --> 01:25:11.600
He set up the sting to kick in 50 years later when the gate was pre-scheduled for his first automatic tech upgrade.

01:25:11.860 --> 01:25:19.370
It was all planned out. He even arranged for his operatives to carry chess pieces to let you know that he had finally gotten back at you.

01:25:20.230 --> 01:25:28.920
But 50 years is a long time. Hex got old. Then he got senile. He completely forgot about the traps that he himself had set.

01:25:30.890 --> 01:25:32.450
Well, it's better for you this way.

01:25:32.880 --> 01:25:34.540
You know he won't expose you now.

01:25:35.050 --> 01:25:37.250
Your dirty little secret will remain a secret.

01:25:37.760 --> 01:25:40.560
He can't tell anyone about the defects you built into the gates.

01:25:41.100 --> 01:25:41.980
So that's it, then.

01:25:42.440 --> 01:25:43.740
You don't have to worry about him.

01:25:44.420 --> 01:25:46.060
You just have to worry about us.

01:25:46.930 --> 01:25:48.970
What do you want? Money? Is that it?

01:25:49.190 --> 01:25:50.330
Come on, say it.

01:25:51.140 --> 01:25:54.000
